
// This yarnscript is for tutorial/specific needs like
// a dialog line after taking a pill, or trying to take one when sanity is high
// dialog after failing the QTE event
// or just anything that you don't want to link to a specific character
// these nodes get called through scripts.


//IF you want to alter variables in another YScript, you can do it from this one,
// as all YScripts share variables 

// (ex if you want to update the relationship stats they have with their assitant if they fail the QTE)//

title: FullSanity
---
I don't feel the need to take anything right now.
===
title: QteFail
---
REEVES: Lennox? Whats going on over there?
LENNOX: W-What do you mean?
REEVES: Your hands are shaking. Is everything OK?
LENNOX: Yeah, I'm good. Don't worry about it.
===
title: QteYellow
---
REEVES: Lysen? Is everything OK over there? You've been still for a while.
LENNOX: Y-yeah, just needed a moment.
*Damn, she noticed..*
===
title: NoPills
